  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Headline numbers\n",
    "\n",
    "`total_distance_mm` and the speed stats only use steps where both endpoints are real or\n",
    "short-gap-interpolated points — a long untracked stretch never gets counted as if the larva\n",
    "teleported across it. `pct_time_untracked` and `longest_untracked_stretch_s` tell you how much\n",
    "of this particular video to actually trust.\n"
   ],
   "id": "bd3b273ebe9f4dd0"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:09.128412Z",
     "start_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:09.121317Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "stats = summarize(df)\n",
    "for k, v in stats.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"{k:32s}: {v:.4f}\" if isinstance(v, (int, float, np.floating)) else f\"{k:32s}: {v}\")\n"
   ],
   "id": "29363fffb1625d2a",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "total_frames                    : 5402.0000\n",
      "pct_time_untracked              : 0.3147\n",
      "longest_untracked_stretch_s     : 0.0000\n",
      "n_short_gaps_interpolated       : 0\n",
      "n_outliers_rejected             : 17\n",
      "n_speed_outliers                : 0\n",
      "total_distance_mm               : 142.6877\n",
      "mean_speed_mm_s                 : 0.7952\n",
      "median_speed_mm_s               : 0.5955\n",
      "max_speed_mm_s                  : 4.7184\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "execution_count": 132
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Flagged frames (possible false detections)\n",
    "\n",
    "Automatic outlier rejection compares each point to the median position of its local window;\n",
    "the frames it rejected are grouped into events below for a quick human sanity check — most\n",
    "videos should show zero or a couple of short entries here.\n"
   ],
   "id": "6799d2bd5fa2f63a"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:09.229694Z",
     "start_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:09.217877Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "list_flagged_events(df)\n"
   ],
   "id": "1d774b2cb6697d7c",
