  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Comparing larvae: distance and speed\n",
    "\n",
    "Bar chart of total distance per larva, plus a boxplot of per-frame speeds so you can see\n",
    "spread as well as central tendency.\n"
   ],
   "id": "2b2da86400cc3203"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:11.683718Z",
     "start_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:11.557568Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(max(6, 0.5 * len(summary_table)), 4))\n",
    "labels = [Path(f).stem for f in summary_table.index]\n",
    "colors = [\"tab:red\" if f else \"tab:blue\" for f in summary_table[\"flagged\"]]\n",
    "ax.bar(labels, summary_table[\"total_distance_mm\"], color=colors)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Total distance (mm)\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Total distance traveled per larva (red = flagged)\")\n",
    "plt.xticks(rotation=90)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ],
   "id": "54deccd7e466da30",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 600x400 with 1 Axes>"
      ],
      "image/png": ""
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data",
     "jetTransient": {
      "display_id": null
     }
    }
   ],
   "execution_count": 141
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:11.776679Z",
     "start_time": "2026-09-10T23:14:11.690755Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
    "speed_cols = [\"mean_speed_mm_s\", \"median_speed_mm_s\", \"max_speed_mm_s\"]\n",
    "summary_table[speed_cols].boxplot(ax=ax)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Speed (mm/s)\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Speed distribution across larvae\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ],
   "id": "5a256ce6e65102ea",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>"
      ],
      "image/png": ""
     },
     "metadata": {},
